    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Index as hash</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sign marking</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/set-mismatch/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 645</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Set Mismatch</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Values are 1..n, so each value owns a slot: flip nums[v-1] negative when v arrives. A slot that is already negative names the duplicate; the one slot still positive at the end names the missing value. O(n) time, O(1) extra space, and a second pass restores the input.</p>\n"
  },
